"""
LAYER +32: REGIME-SPECIFIC STRATEGY ROUTER (ULTIMATE OPTIMIZED)
Purpose: Route to the best strategy for current market regime with ADAPTIVE intelligence.
Balance: GOLDILOCKS - NOT too strict (misses profit) and NOT too loose (takes losses).

KEY FEATURES:
- Detects 7 market regimes automatically
- Routes to specific strategies per regime
- ADAPTIVE: Changes based on real-time conditions
- PROFIT-FOCUSED: Prioritizes profitable opportunities
- LOSS PREVENTION: Built-in protection per regime
- SMOOTH TRANSITIONS: No sudden strategy changes
- PERFORMANCE FEEDBACK: Learns from past results
- REGIME CONFIDENCE: Only switches with high confidence
"""

